### =========================================================================
### ShopCore API - End-to-End Checkout Test
### Run each request top-to-bottom by clicking "Send Request" above it.
### Requires the API running (http profile => http://localhost:5274).
### =========================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5274
@contentType = application/json

### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 1. Register a new user (skip if you already have one -> go to Login)
### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name register
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "Name": "Test User",
  "Email": "testuser@example.com",
  "Password": "Test@12345"
}

### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 2. Login -> captures the AccessToken + UserId for the calls below
### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "Email": "testuser@example.com",
  "Password": "Test@12345"
}

### Grab token + userId from the login response above
@token = {{login.response.body.AccessToken}}
@userId = {{login.response.body.UserId}}

### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 3. Browse the catalog -> find a real ProductId to buy
### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products?page=1&pageSize=10

### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 4. Add an item to the cart
###    Replace ProductId / UnitPrice / Description with a real product from step 3.
### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/cart/update
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "UserId": "{{userId}}",
  "Added": [
    {
      "ProductId": 1,
      "Description": "Sample Product",
      "Quantity": 1,
      "UnitPrice": 499.00,
      "UserId": "{{userId}}"
    }
  ],
  "Updated": [],
  "Removed": []
}

### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 5. STEP 1 - Begin checkout (reserve stock + create Pending order)
###    NOTE the required Idempotency-Key header. Captures the returned OrderId.
### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name begin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/checkout/begin
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: test-order-0001

{
  "UserId": "{{userId}}",
  "OrderDetails": {
    "FirstName": "Test",
    "LastName": "User",
    "Email": "testuser@example.com",
    "Address": "123 Main St",
    "Address2": "",
    "Country": "India",
    "State": "WB",
    "Zip": "700001"
  }
}

### Grab the created OrderId
@orderId = {{begin.response.body.OrderId}}

### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 6. STEP 2 - Pay (success) -> confirms order + enqueues fulfillment
###    Set "Success": false to instead test stock release (returns 402).
### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/payment/pay
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "OrderId": "{{orderId}}",
  "Success": true
}

### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 7. After ~5-10s, the OutboxRelayService settles stock + publishes to
###    Service Bus, and the FulfillmentWorker emails + stores the invoice.
###    Verify the invoice was persisted:
### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orderedItems/get-invoice?userId={{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 8. (Optional) Health check - SQL + Redis
### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
